From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Mirror the cover camera preview

On the cover Camera shoots with the rear lenses (0006), which face the user
there, so the preview showed the user unmirrored, unlike a selfie. Mirror it
the way the stock Flip cover camera (QuickShot) and Fold5 rear cam selfie do,
through the preview's mirror mode: pictures and videos still save unflipped.
The flip applies to the camera's buffer, so upright on the cover takes the
horizontal one and sideways the vertical one; turning between the two while
the preview runs reconnects the camera to switch. "Mirror cover screen
preview" under Selfies in Camera settings turns it off. The inner panel and
DeX stay unmirrored.

